    "shortDescription": "Watch this side-by-side comparison of G-Wagons from 2000 - 2018 to rank the best and worst for interiors, engines, and reliability. This is part 1 of a multi-video series for buying and building your dream G Wagon. \n\nThanks to Joe, the G Wagon Expert at Alliance Auto Care in Loveland, CO, for helping prepare our Buyer's Guide (link below) and for helping me on this series. Have a dream G Wagon build? \n\nCONTACT JOE: \nhttps://allianceautocare.com/ \n[email redacted] \n[phone redacted] \n\nWatch all the videos in this Buyer's & Build series in this playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLHeawKfarQSPKIjpe86at3Ttc2sz7uD_b\n\nFREE G-Wagon's Buyer's Guide: https://docs.google.com/document/d/12AuluAdmYzX5J3fkvwb2Vcos9EYJr1mSu7M1WzFkAhE/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#gwagen  #gwagon  #gclass  #gwheeln",
